cal slope of the curve. It does not make the curve linear; the secant slope from x = 1 to x = 2 is 3, not 2.</p>\n  </section>\n  <p class=\"caption\">A prepared lesson. Ask for a visual explanation.</p>\n</div>","summary":"Added a comparison section with two cards showing the tangent change of 2 and the curve change of 3 from x=1 to x=2, concluding that the derivative is a local slope, not a finite change.","checks":{"pass":true,"checks":[{"name":"Bounded HTML source","pass":true},{"name":"Passive allowlisted HTML/SVG only","pass":true},{"name":"Single preserved root","pass":true}]},"outputHash":"c1b8d4e9af71480eb06f8259e29f226792f976cd2735e05b35384f9a98e564e4","domChecks":{"pass":true,"checks":[{"name":"Recording tab stayed visible","pass":true},{"name":"Entire lesson frame is in the recording viewport","pass":true},{"name":"Lesson root was rendered","pass":true},{"name":"One lesson root","pass":true},{"name":"Original graph viewBox","pass":true},{"name":"Original parabola preserved","pass":true},{"name":"Original point preserved","pass":true},{"name":"Graph elements have SVG semantics","pass":true},{"name":"Original lesson text preserved","pass":true},{"name":"Comparison section","pass":true},{"name":"Tangent change label","pass":true},{"name":"Curve change label","pass":true},{"name":"Known task","pass":true},{"name":"Changed element is visible: #tangent-card","pass":true},{"name":"Changed element is visible: #curve-card","pass":true}]},"reviewedAt":"2026-09-18T20:29:00.132Z"},{"runId":"d28e331e-3d33-4701-a1bb-21beee6c93a1","pairId":"47a6ae5d-3604-492b-978c-f5fade77a4e4","protocolVersion":"lesson-code-edit-effort-medium-v1","lane":"cerebras-qwen","taskId":"T1","phase":"measured","startedAt":"2026-09-18T20:29:01.363Z","status":"rendered","review":"pass","sourceHash":"50f56011f364744ca38f2fc8947c977bcc1d76d43351dbbe9f43ec6d6cdfae3d","promptHash":"671557108c1467af8f817c3ef4248fc1cb57d2c6cf83b9f0ec301d3276f7e14b","schemaHash":"ec3f016890518cfdbf8459927d34ed56f47d064